      With nothing plugged into the motor, encoder or limit
      switch connectors these should all read 0, held there by
      That list is v0.2's and does not hold on v0.3, where
      REFL_STEP = 1 is CORRECT with the switch unplugged and
      the check below is simply wrong: U1301's IN pin has no
      external pull -- it reaches only J1301 pad 2 -- so the
      MAX6816 supplies its own pull-up, drives OUT high, and
      nothing can override a driven output. There is no
      LIMIT_SW pull-down anywhere on v0.3.
