      vsense = 0
      This board fits 0.15 ohm shunts. vsense resets to 0, and
      0 with 0.15 ohm is roughly 1.8x the motor's rated current.
      Stage 3 must set it to 1 and read it back BEFORE it lowers
      ~{TMC_DRV_EN}. Stage 2 only reports it.
